# Dustwallow Marsh (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 12 flagged rares a Horde player can actually engage and the zone's fixed containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or standalone.
# EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route. Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper is the rare. The two Alliance-aligned rares (Malgin, Gerogg) are killable opposition for Horde players and say so; both sit below the band and say that too. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest. The Loose Dirt mound (1238/1239's start-object) belongs to the core route, not here. Atrexis (96986's ender) has no spawn anywhere and carries no usable point - logged in the inventory, never a step. See docs/dustwallow-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dustwallow-horde-rares
title Dustwallow Marsh (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-45
zone Dustwallow Marsh
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords dustwallow, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Brimgore - the far south

  zone map 1445

  goto 42.12,75.94
  kill 4339 optional
  collect 285063 "Black Brood Battleguards" optional
  note Level 45 rare, flagged rare in the data, at the top of the band in the far south; its sole drop is the Black Brood Battleguards. No quest takes it in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Darkmist Widow - the west

  zone map 1445

  goto 31.15,20.4
  kill 4380 optional
  collect 285102 "Darkmist Dirk" optional
  note Level 40 rare, flagged rare in the data, in the west; its sole drop is the Darkmist Dirk. The Unpopped Darkmist Eye it also drops is the core 1206 objective's item - the hunt rides the core guide, noted here, never an accept.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

