step Malgin Barleybrew - below the band, killable opposition

  zone map 1445

  goto 27.2,58.6
  kill 5848 optional
  collect 286541 "Bael'dun Tankard" optional
  note Level 25 rare, flagged rare in the data, below the guide band - come back at a higher level; its sole drop is the Bael'dun Tankard (his other drops are generic vendor drinks). Flagged Alliance-faction in the data: an enemy to Horde players - expect opposition.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

