  note Twelve Solid Chest placements, nineteen more Solid Chest placements across the south, three Alliance Chest plus three Alliance Strongbox placements at the same three points (no faction lock in the data), one Alliance Chest far north, Food Crate and Armor/Weapon Crate clusters, seven Milk barrel placements, one Captain's Footlocker, one Damaged Crate, and one Gizmorium Shipping Crate (Horde-side addition - the data shows a fixed point, loot and no quest link; the Alliance inventory omits it). All hold ordinary low-level goods; no unique treasure confirmed.
  note No contract quest takes an object objective from any of these containers. Objects the Alliance guide routes here that have no 1445 spawn anywhere (Alliance Chests 4096/105579, Alliance Strongbox 105570, Battered Footlockers, Camp/Unopened Crates, Ambermill Strongbox) are not shipped - flagged in the inventory, never harmonized. The Keg that starts the core's Ruined Kegs is that quest's object-start and is not covered here. Respawn timers unconfirmed.

